 "kit": "An Ember Skirmisher, a light runner: a sleeveless dull ember-orange tunic from the collar down to just above the knees, front and back, belted with dark leather; a wide dull ember-orange scarf wound over the head and around the shoulders with two long tails flying behind; lean arms and legs whose ash-grey skin is blackened with soot, painted as living skin with warm lights and cool shadows, never as grey clay; dark charcoal cloth wrapped tightly round the forearms and from the knees to the ankles; a dark leather harness across the chest; a bundle of three short iron-tipped javelins in the off hand and one ready in the throwing hand; a long knife at the belt (in the windup and strike cells the knife is in hand). No armour, no shield, no horns.",
